# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# MailBridge — frontend environment
# Copy to .env.local. All Vite variables are exposed to the browser,
# so never put the Google client secret (or any secret) here.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Where the API lives.
#
# Leave as /api during local development: vite.config.ts proxies /api to
# http://localhost:4000, which keeps the app same-origin and lets the httpOnly
# session cookie work without CORS credentials juggling.
#
# Point it at the full backend URL only when the two run on different origins,
# e.g. VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:4000/api
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api
